[{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0265","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0265.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-3589","title":"Apple Safari WebKit 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Apple Safari 6.0 之前版本所使用的 WebKit 渲染引擎存在内存破坏漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造恶意网站向目标用户发起攻击，当用户使用受影响版本的 Safari 浏览器访问该网站时，浏览器在解析网页内容过程中触发内存损坏，可导致应用程序崩溃或远程执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 macOS 和 iOS 平台上所有使用受影响 WebKit 版本的 Safari 浏览器，攻击者无需事先获取目标系统凭据，只需诱骗用户打开恶意网页即可完成利用，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-3589"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-07-25T20:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:43:31Z","remediation":"升级 Apple Safari 浏览器至 6.0 版本（需 OS X Lion v10.7.4 或更高版本），或安装 Apple 2012 年 7 月 25 日发布的安全更新（APPLE-SA-2012-07-25-1）。iOS 用户应升级至 iOS 6.0。临时缓解措施：避免访问未知或恶意网站，不点击可疑链接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5400","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5485","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9e1d600240836820e3a1b1e4977c0af8cbdc05f2/cves/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3589.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-3589","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/97ee81b7fd22aa607f2e870c57709c6d893c5430/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-3589.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-3589.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3589.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2012-3589.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/b41e970743d15aec60299cbc12139ba5a0ac3bb6/content/CVE-2012-3589.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3589.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-35xx/CVE-2012-3589.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/49d534031f059b5baeabd1b01333339621c7c95a/2012/CVE-2012-3589.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2012/POC-AVE-2012-0265.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0265.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0185","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0185.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-1520","title":"Apple Safari WebKit内存破坏漏洞","description":"Apple Safari 6.0 之前版本使用的 WebKit 引擎中存在内存破坏漏洞，远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问特制网站触发该漏洞，成功利用可导致任意代码执行或应用程序崩溃。该漏洞源于 WebKit 在处理畸形网页内容时存在内存处理错误，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害严重。Apple 已在 Safari 6.0 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-1520"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-07-25T20:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:39:40Z","remediation":"立即将 Apple Safari 升级至 6.0 及以上版本（Apple 于 2012 年 7 月 25 日发布 Safari 6.0 修复了该漏洞），同时确保 iOS 设备升级至 iOS 6.0 及以上。如无法升级，可禁用 JavaScript 解析或使用内容安全策略（CSP）限制不可信网页加载作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5400","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5485","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a0edea60322bafbed67887cf7a4d97a55df8a9fa/cves/2012/1xxx/CVE-2012-1520.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-1520","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/20