 Safari 升级至 6.0 或更高版本（OS X Lion v10.7.4 及以上系统适用），可通过 Apple 软件更新或从 support.apple.com/kb/HT5400 下载安装。使用 iTunes 10.6.3 的用户应将 iTunes 升级至最新版本。iOS 设备用户应升级至 iOS 6.0 或更高版本（设置 > 通用 > 软件更新）。如无法升级，建议禁用 WebKit 渲染或使用其他浏览器（如 Chrome/Firefox）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5400","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5485","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b37ddadc32d456372cb07846a95b411ce7a32d9f/cves/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0682.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-0682","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-0682.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-0682.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0682.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2012-0682.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2012-0682.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0682.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-06xx/CVE-2012-0682.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7597ddfeff03aa9cd00b0ce83a368fad007497d9/2012/CVE-2012-0682.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0148.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0327","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0327.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-3650","title":"Apple Safari WebKit SVG渲染内存信息泄露漏洞","description":"Apple Safari 6.0 之前的版本中，WebKit 引擎在渲染 SVG 图像时存在内存访问错误，会访问未初始化的内存位置。远程攻击者可利用此缺陷，通过诱导用户访问恶意网页，获取进程内存中的敏感信息。该漏洞无需身份认证即可触发，影响使用旧版 Safari 的 macOS 与 iOS 设备。Apple 已在 Safari 6.0 中修复此问题，用户应及时升级浏览器版本以消除风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-3650"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-07-25T19:55:05Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:43:39Z","remediation":"升级到 Safari 6.0（OS X Lion v10.7.4 或 OS X Lion Server v10.7.4）或 iOS 6（iPhone 3GS 及后续机型、iPod touch 第4代及后续机型、iPad 2 及后续机型）。Apple 已在 Safari 6 和 iOS 6 中通过改进 SVG 图像的内存初始化修复了该问题。如无法立即升级，可临时禁用浏览器中的 JavaScript 或避免访问不可信网站以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5400","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/54703","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a64d14d4e99e9e15688962dcc640f9e44c67eb2/cves/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3650.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-3650","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d547588420a9a1d22d6d9d3bde1463155fe33c31/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-3650.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-3650.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3650.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2012-3650.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8ad35b62b45404de8f2963cc958f5644815c9afa/content/CVE-2012-3650.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2012/3xxx/CVE-2012-3650.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-36xx/CVE-2012-3650.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/b290a4630bf00bc86efda07bc07c03b933274d3f/2012/CVE-2012-3650.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0327.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0147","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0147.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-0680","title":"Apple Safari 密码自动填充认证绕过漏洞","description":"Apple Safari 浏览器在 6.0 版本之前未正确处理密码输入元素的 autocomplete 属性，当网页明确禁止自动填充时，浏览器仍会自动填写已保存的密码。攻击者可利用无人值守的工作站，通过已自动填充密码的页面绕过身份验证机制，获取未授权的访问权限。该漏洞影响 Apple iOS 5.1.1 及更早版本中的 Safari 浏览器，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2012-0680"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-07-25T19:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:38:03Z","remediation":"升级 Apple Safari 至 6.0 或更高版本（OS X 用户通过 Software Update 或从 support.apple.com/kb/HT5400 下载安装）；iOS 设备用户升级至 iOS 6.0 或更高版本（设置→通用→软件更新）。如无法立即升级，可在 Safari 偏好设置中禁用自动填充密码功能（偏好设置→自动填充→取消勾选\"用户名和密码\"），并要求用户在使用完毕后手动锁定工作站。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5400","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/54688","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b37ddadc32d456372cb07846a95b411ce7a32d9f/cves/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0680.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-0680","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-0680.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-0680.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0680.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2012-0680.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2012-0680.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0680.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-06xx/CVE-2012-0680.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7597ddfeff03aa9cd00b0ce83a368fad007497d9/2012/CVE-2012-0680.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2012/POC-AVE-2012-0147.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0147.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0146","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0146.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-0679","title":"Apple Safari 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Apple Safari 6.0 之前版本在处理 feed:// 协议 URL 时存在访问控制错误。远程攻击者可构造包含本地文件路径的恶意 feed:// URL，诱使用户在 Safari 浏览器中点击访问，从而导致用户本地系统上的敏感文件被泄露到远程服务器。该漏洞影响 macOS 和 Windows 平台上的 Safari 浏览器，攻击者无需身份认证，仅需诱骗用户点击恶意链接即可在用户交互条件下读取本地任意文件，可能造成隐私数据或敏感信息泄露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-0679"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-07-25T19:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:38:03Z","remediation":"将 Apple Safari 浏览器升级至 6.0 或更高版本以修复该漏洞。具体操作：打开 Safari 浏览器，点击菜单栏\"Safari\"→\"关于 Safari\"检查当前版本；若低于 6.0，请通过 Mac App Store 或 Apple 官网下载安装 Safari 6.0 或更高版本。升级完成后，建议在 Safari 偏好设置中禁用不必要的 feed:// 协议处理器以减少攻击面。如无法立即升级，可暂时避免访问来源不可信的 feed:// 链接作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5400","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a14f4e66db68a75a9270d6c9081e9ffb7f931cd8/cves/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0679.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-0679","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-0679.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-0679.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0679.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0679.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2012-0679.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2012-0679.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-06xx/CVE-2012-0679.json","https://github.com/TheMirkin/CVE-List-Public-Exploits/blob/f496d51148a2b151f14fe6d0bef5b42ee27f6ccb/CVE List/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0679.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0146.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0145","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0145.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-0678","title":"Apple Safari 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Apple Safari 浏览器 WebKit 渲染引擎存在跨站脚本漏洞，攻击者可通过构造恶意的 feed:// URL 向目标用户注入任意 JavaScript 代码或 HTML 内容。该漏洞影响 Safari 6.0 之前的所有版本，当用户使用受影响版本的 Safari 访问包含恶意 feed:// 链接的网页时，攻击者即可在用户浏览器上下文中执行任意脚本，窃取会话 Cookie、重定向用户至钓鱼网站或篡改页面内容。攻击者无需身份认证，只需诱骗用户点击恶意链接即可完成攻击，CVSS v2 评分为 4.3，危害等级为中危。Apple 已在 Safari 6.0 中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-0678"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-07-25T19:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:38:03Z","remediation":"立即将 Safari 浏览器升级至 6.0 或更高版本，此修复包含在 Apple 2012 年 7 月发布的安全更新中。OS X Mountain Lion 用户可通过系统偏好设置中的软件更新或 Mac App Store 获取，OS X Lion 用户需先升级至 10.7.4 再安装 Safari 6.0。若暂无法升级，建议临时切换至其他受支持的现代浏览器以规避跨站脚本风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Jul/msg00000.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5400","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a14f4e66db68a75a9270d6c9081e9ffb7f931cd8/cves/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0678.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-0678","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-0678.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-0678.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0678.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0678.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2012-0678.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2012-0678.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-06xx/CVE-2012-0678.json","https://github.com/TheMirkin/CVE-List-Public-Exploits/blob/f496d51148a2b151f14fe6d0bef5b42ee27f6ccb/CVE List/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0678.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0145.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0232","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0232.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-1967","title":"Mozilla Firefox/Thunderbird/SeaMonkey JavaScript沙箱绕过权限提升漏洞","description":"Mozilla Firefox/Thunderbird/SeaMonkey 的 JavaScript 沙箱工具实现存在权限提升漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 javascript: URL，在沙箱外以提升的权限执行任意 JavaScript 代码，完全绕过安全沙箱限制。该漏洞影响 Firefox 4.x 至 13.0、Firefox ESR 10.x 至 10.0.5、Thunderbird 5.0 至 13.0、Thunderbird ESR 10.x 至 10.0.5 及 SeaMonkey 2.11 之前版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。攻击无需身份认证，利用复杂度低，可导致机密性、完整性和可用性完全丧失。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2012-1967"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-07-18T10:26:49Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:40:41Z","remediation":"升级 Firefox 至 14.0 及以上版本，Firefox ESR 升级至 10.0.6 及以上版本；Thunderbird 升级至 14.0 及以上版本或 ESR 10.0.6；SeaMonkey 升级至 2.11 及以上版本。无法立即升级时，禁用 JavaScript（about:config 中设置 javascript.enabled=false）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-07/msg00011.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-07/msg00012.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-07/msg00013.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-07/msg00016.html","http://osvdb.org/84013","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-1088.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/49963","http://secunia.com/advisories/49964","http://secunia.com/advisories/49965","http://secunia.com/advisories/49968","http://secunia.com/advisories/49972","http://secunia.com/advisories/49977","http://secunia.com/advisories/49979","http://secunia.com/advisories/49992","http://secunia.com/advisories/49993","http://secunia.com/advisories/49994","http://www.debian.org/security/2012/dsa-2514","http://www.debian.org/security/2012/dsa-2528","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2012/mfsa2012-56.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/54573","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1027256","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1027257","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1027258","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1509-1","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1509-2","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1510-1","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=758344","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A17025","htt