过HTTPS证书验证机制，实施中间人攻击窃取敏感信息。该漏洞利用需要用户交互，CVSS评分4.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.0,"aliases":["CVE-2012-1964"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-07-18T10:26:49Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:40:41Z","remediation":"升级 Firefox 至 14.0 及以上版本，Firefox ESR 升级至 10.0.6 及以上版本，Thunderbird 升级至 ESR 10.0.6 及以上版本，SeaMonkey 升级至 2.10 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器或反向代理层为 about:certerror 页面添加 X-Frame-Options: DENY 响应头，禁止页面被嵌入 iframe，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-07/msg00011.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-07/msg00012.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-07/msg00013.html","http://osvdb.org/84011","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-1088.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/49965","http://secunia.com/advisories/49972","http://secunia.com/advisories/49977","http://secunia.com/advisories/49979","http://secunia.com/advisories/49992","http://secunia.com/advisories/49993","http://secunia.com/advisories/49994","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2012/mfsa2012-54.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/54581","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1509-1","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1509-2","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=633691","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A16783","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2012/CVE-2012-1964.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2012/CVE-2012-1964.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86965a1ef7a64a35a4bffc5193446981deb1b2f5/cves/2012/1xxx/CVE-2012-1964.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-1964","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-1964","https://github.com/ma