ME元素的恶意网页，诱使用户访问，从而实施点击劫持攻击，在用户不知情的情况下劫持其点击操作，导致信息泄露或未授权操作。攻击者需诱导用户访问恶意页面，攻击复杂度较高。Mozilla已在Firefox 14.0及相应更新版本中修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-1961"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-07-18T10:26:49Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:40:40Z","remediation":"升级 Firefox 至 14.0 及以上版本，Firefox ESR 升级至 10.0.6 及以上版本，Thunderbird 升级至 14.0 及以上版本，Thunderbird ESR 升级至 10.0.6 及以上版本，SeaMonkey 升级至 2.11 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器端配置 X-Frame-Options 响应头去重逻辑，仅保留首个有效值。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-07/msg00011.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-07/msg00012.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-07/msg00013.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-07/msg00016.html","http://osvdb.org/84003","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-1088.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/49965","http://secunia.com/advisories/49968","http://secunia.com/advisories/49972","http://secunia.com/advisories/49977","http://secunia.com/advisories/49979","http://secunia.com/advisories/49992","http://secunia.com/advisories/49993","http://secunia.com/advisories/49994","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2012/mfsa2012-51.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/54584","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1027256","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1027257","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1027258","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1509-1","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1509-2","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1510-1","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=761655","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A16993","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2012/CVE-2012-1961.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2012/CVE-2012-1961.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7db89